      "message": "Yea, in hindsight adding the DC doesn\u0027t provide very much signal because presumably a DC will only have a single target texture?\n\nHowever, I found that label didn\u0027t provide signal either so I left it out?\n```\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d RECORDING 1 \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n**** FLUSH TOKEN 154 Recorder::Snap ****\n0: Draw Task (target\u003d0x17252f6c0) (DC\u003d0x17253b7d0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734_ChildDevice)\n└── RenderPass Task\n1: Draw Task (target\u003d0x172544bf0) (DC\u003d0x1725290d0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734)\n│   Draw Task (target\u003d0x17252f6c0) (DC\u003d0x17253b7d0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734_ChildDevice)\n│   └── RenderPass Task\n└── RenderPass Task\n2: Draw Task (target\u003d0x17254c3d0) (DC\u003d0x172530cc0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734_ChildDevice)\n└── RenderPass Task\n3: Draw Task (target\u003d0x172544bf0) (DC\u003d0x1725290d0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734)\n│   Draw Task (target\u003d0x17254c3d0) (DC\u003d0x172530cc0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734_ChildDevice)\n│   └── RenderPass Task\n│   Copy TtoT Task: Src\u003d0x172544bf0 Dst\u003d0x172547880\n└── RenderPass Task\n4: Draw Task (target\u003d0x172544bf0) (DC\u003d0x1725290d0) (Label\u003dIOSurface_CanvasResourceRaster_Pid:35734)\n│   Copy TtoT Task: Src\u003d0x172544bf0 Dst\u003d0x17254c130\n└── RenderPass Task\n--------------- END ---------------\n```",
